{"nodes": [{"id": "src_help_playlists_article", "label": "Playlists, tags and the builder (help article)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "src_help_playlists_building_a_playlist", "label": "Building a playlist", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GLUE picks songs from the collection and puts them in an order that flows; the builder opens from one or more selected songs, and the songs chosen go where they fit the flow."}, {"id": "src_help_playlists_flow", "label": "Flow", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A shape (Steady, Warm-up, Build to a peak, Peak and down, Peaks and breathers, Cool-down) bent by dragging the curve's points; Tempo follows the flow makes the BPM rise and fall with it."}, {"id": "src_help_playlists_energy_1_10", "label": "Energy 1-10", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "How loud, busy and bright a song is next to the rest of the collection; Mixed In Key's Energy N in a comment counts as it is."}, {"id": "src_help_playlists_sound_varied_to_close", "label": "Sound: varied to close", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Each song's sound is compared (spectrum shape, brightness, low end), measured when it is analysed; the slider runs from varied to close to the songs started from and to each other."}, {"id": "src_help_playlists_same_artist_spacing", "label": "Same artist spacing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The same artist is kept 3 songs apart unless the option is unticked."}, {"id": "src_help_playlists_starting_songs_roles", "label": "Roles of the songs to start from", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The songs to start from are not always first: each goes where it fits the flow, or where the user says (Opener, At the peak, Closer)."}, {"id": "src_help_playlists_keep_in_engine_dj", "label": "Keep in Engine DJ", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "With GLUE Home running, a playlist or folder shows in Engine DJ's GLUE folder. Before November 2026 it was kept in step both ways; that is paused, since GLUE no longer writes into Engine DJ."}, {"id": "src_help_playlists_playlists_and_folders", "label": "Playlists and folders", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "+ Playlist and + Folder make them; a deleted playlist goes to Recently deleted first."}, {"id": "src_help_playlists_tags_and_tag_filters", "label": "Tags and tag filters", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The Tags column header (or Filter): each ticked tag narrows to songs with all of them; Show only it here in the sidebar adds tags instead (songs with any of them)."}, {"id": "src_help_playlists_taking_playlists_out_as_m3u8", "label": "Taking playlists out as M3U8", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Drag a playlist out as an M3U8 file, or drag songs into the DJ app; with GLUE Home the drag dock carries songs and playlists into Engine DJ or rekordbox."}, {"id": "src_help_playlists_insights", "label": "Insights", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shows an open playlist's length, tempos, keys and tags."}], "edges": [{"source": "src_help_playlists_article", "target": "src_core_guide_tours_tour_playlists", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_help_playlists_article", "target": "src_help_playlists_building_a_playlist", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_help_playlists_article", "target": "src_help_playlists_playlists_and_folders", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_help_playlists_article", "target": "src_help_playlists_tags_and_tag_filters", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "src_help_playlists_article", "target": "src_help_playlists_taking_playlists_out_as_m3u8", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "src/help/playlists.md", "source_location